 <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.current_logistics_status_name"></span></p><p class="small text-muted">Requested <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.requested_at.formatDate('MMMM d, yyyy, h:mm A')"></span><span dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.logistics_accepted_at"> · Accepted <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.logistics_accepted_at.formatDate('MMMM d, yyyy, h:mm A')"></span> by <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.logistics_accepted_by"></span></span></p><p class="alert alert-info py-2" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.current_logistics_status_code == 'ACCEPTED' && ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'AWAITING_SCHOOL_HANDOFF'">Accepted by TTPost. Awaiting the school’s physical release; this does not mean TTPost has the device.</p><p class="alert alert-warning py-2" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'PENDING_TTPOST_RECEIPT'">School release recorded. Awaiting TTPost receipt; the device is not yet in TTPost custody.</p><p class="alert alert-success py-2" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'TTPOST_CUSTODY'">TTPost received the device. Outbound transit has started. Location: <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.ttpost_location_name"></span>.</p><p class="small mb-2"><strong>Physical handoff state:</strong> <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'AWAITING_SCHOOL_HANDOFF' ? 'Awaiting School Handoff' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'PENDING_TTPOST_RECEIPT' ? 'Awaiting TTPost Receipt' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'TTPOST_CUSTODY' ? 'TTPost Custody - Outbound Transit' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'TTPOST_RETURN_CUSTODY' ? 'TTPost Return Custody' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'PENDING_TTPOST_RETURN_RECEIPT' ? 'Awaiting TTPost Return Receipt' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'PENDING_SCHOOL_RETURN_RECEIPT' ? 'Awaiting School Return Receipt' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.return_state_code == 'RETURNED_TO_SCHOOL' ? 'Returned to School' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'REPAIR_CENTRE_CUSTODY' ? 'Repair Centre Custody' : 'Not recorded'"></span><span dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.ttpost_location_name"> · <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.ttpost_location_name"></span></span></p><a class="btn btn-bmobile-secondary btn-sm" dmx-bind:href="'/logistics/detail?id=' + ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.logistics_case_id">View Logistics</a></div><p class="text-muted mb-0" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.current_status.code != 'APPROVED_FOR_PICKUP' && ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.is_active != 1">Pickup request becomes available after District approval.</p><p class="text-muted mb-0" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.device_has_active_logistics_case && ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.is_active != 1">This device already has an active logistics case.</p></section><section class="col-12 portal-section ticket-detail-return" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.current_logistics_status_code == 'READY_FOR_RETURN' || ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.current_logistics_status_code == 'RETURN_IN_TRANSIT' || ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.current_logistics_status_code == 'RETURNED_TO_SCHOOL'"><h2 class="h5">Repair Centre to School Return</h2><p class="mb-2"><strong>Physical return state:</strong> <span dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'PENDING_TTPOST_RETURN_RECEIPT' ? 'Awaiting TTPost Return Receipt' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'TTPOST_RETURN_CUSTODY' ? 'TTPost Return Custody / Return In Transit' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.physical_state_code == 'PENDING_SCHOOL_RETURN_RECEIPT' ? 'Awaiting School Return Receipt' : ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.return_state_code == 'RETURNED_TO_SCHOOL' ? 'Returned to School' : 'Ready for Return'"></span></p><dl class="row mb-2"><dt class="col-sm-3">Return Device</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.asset_tag || ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.serial_number"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3">Ticket Status</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.current_status.name"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3">Logistics Status</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.current_logistics_status_name"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3">Return Device Lifecycle</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.device_lifecycle_name"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3">Return Device Allocation</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.allocation_custody_level"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.school_name">Returned School</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.school_name" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.school_name"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.returned_at">Returned At</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.returned_at" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.returned_at_display"></dd><dt class="col-sm-3" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.received_by_display_name">Received By</dt><dd class="col-sm-9" dmx-show="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.received_by_display_name" dmx-text="ticketDetail.data.returned_school.received_by_display_name"></dd></dl><a class="btn btn-bmobile-secondary btn-sm" dmx-bind:href="'/logistics/detail?id=' + ticketDetail.data.active_logistics_case.logistics_case_id">View Return Logistics</a></section><section class="mt-4 ticket-detail-diagnosis"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 bor