_code : '') : activity_type == 'LOGISTICS' && activity_code == 'SCHOOL_RETURN_DEVICE_RECEIVED' ? 'School Received Returned Device' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'LOGISTICS' && activity_code == 'RETURNED_TO_SCHOOL' ? 'Returned to School' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'REPAIR' && activity_code == 'REPAIR_STARTED' ? 'Repair Started' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'REPAIR' && activity_code == 'REPAIR_ASSESSMENT_RECORDED' ? 'Repair Assessment Recorded' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'REPAIR' && activity_code == 'REPAIR_WORK_RECORDED' ? 'Repair Work Recorded' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'REPAIR' && activity_code == 'REPAIR_COMPLETED' ? 'Repair Completed' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'REPAIR' && activity_code == 'REPAIR_DISPOSITION_RECORDED' ? 'Repair Disposition Recorded' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'EXCEPTION' && activity_code == 'EXCEPTION_REVIEW_STARTED' ? 'Exception Review Started' : activity_type == 'EXCEPTION' && activity_code == 'EXCEPTION_ASSESSMENT_RECORDED' ? 'Warranty / Responsibility Assessment Recorded' : activity_type == 'EXCEPTION' && activity_code == 'MANUFACTURER_RETURN_APPROVED' ? 'Manufacturer Return Approved' : activity_type == 'EXCEPTION' && activity_code == 'REPLACEMENT_APPROVAL_REQUESTED' ? 'Permanent Replacement Approval Requested' : activity_type == 'EXCEPTION' && activity_code == 'REPLACEMENT_APPROVED' ? 'Permanent Replacement Approved' : activity_type == 'EXCEPTION' && activity_code == 'EXCEPTION_RETURNED_FOR_REVIEW' ? 'Exception Returned for Review' : activity_type == 'PERMANENT_REPLACEMENT' && activity_code == 'PERMANENT_REPLACEMENT_STARTED' ? 'Permanent Replacement Started' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'PERMANENT_REPLACEMENT' && activity_code == 'PERMANENT_REPLACEMENT_SELECTED' ? 'Replacement Source Selected' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : activity_type == 'PERMANENT_REPLACEMENT' && activity_code == 'PERMANENT_REPLACEMENT_COMPLETED' ? 'Permanent Replacement Completed' + (reference_code ? ' — ' + reference_code : '') : 'Ticket activity'"></td><td dmx-text="actor_display_name || 'System'"></td><td dmx-text="subject_display_name || '-'">-</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="text-muted" dmx-show="ticketActivity.data.activity.count() == 0">No activity recorded.</p><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" dmx-show="ticketActivity.lastError.status" dmx-text="ticketActivity.lastError.response && ticketActivity.lastError.response.error ? ticketActivity.lastError.response.error : 'Ticket activity could not be loaded.'"></div></section>
